	(text_box "Seqüencia GPIO Bootloader.\n--------------------\n\nInici en mode STM32 funcional:\n\nSTM32 GPIO RST = 3V3\nSTM32 GPIO BOOT = GND\n\n\nActivar mode Bootloader:\n\nSTM32 GPIO RST = GND\nSTM32 GPIO BOOT = 3V3\ndelay(500);\nSTM32 GPIO RST = 3V3\n\n\nTornar a mode funcioanl:\n\nSTM32 GPIO RST = GND\ndelay(500);\nSTM32 GPIO RST = 3V3\nSTM32 GPIO BOOT = GND"
